~ start
if Game.flags.get("met_guide", false)
	Guide: Back again? The coins won't collect themselves.
	=> END
Guide: Oh! A visitor. Welcome to the test level.
do Game.flags["met_guide"] = true
Guide: Everything here is built from kit parts. What do you want to know?
- How do I move?
	Guide: Arrows or A/D to run, Space to jump. Hold it to jump higher.
- What is that red thing?
	Guide: A patrolling enemy. It chases you if you get close. Spikes hurt too.
- Nothing, thanks.
	Guide: Suit yourself.
Guide: Press Escape any time to pause or save.
=> END
